Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:02:01.02,0:02:01.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:03:31.98,0:03:32.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:10:08.05,0:10:08.09,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
