Comment: 50,0:23:52.99,0:23:53.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.13,0:00:24.21,Default,Makeup Artist,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:24.88,0:00:29.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nothing! Just thinking,\N"wow, I'm really an idol!"
Dialogue: 50,0:00:30.26,0:00:31.55,Default,Makeup Artist,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.31,0:00:37.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So pretty!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.81,0:00:40.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You two look motivated.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:40.81,0:00:41.69,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.69,0:00:44.07,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh! Good morning, ma'am!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:44.07,0:00:45.53,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Are you all ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.53,0:00:46.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.07,0:00:48.95,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Why did I get roped into this...?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:48.95,0:00:51.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly wanted us all to be here!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.32,0:00:54.28,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lulu wouldn't have debuted without her help.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.62,0:00:57.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This show is so much fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:57.75,0:00:59.75,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I watch it every week!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:00.16,0:01:01.29,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:01.29,0:01:02.42,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I do too!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.71,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's super rare we all get\Nto work together on something!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:06.71,0:01:09.17,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,And a TV appearance will\Nbring more gigs to the agency!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.17,0:01:10.38,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.38,0:01:11.80,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Good luck out there!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.64,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:13.64,0:01:15.18,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Is Rin-chan ready to go?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.18,0:01:16.06,Default,AD,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:24.31,0:01:25.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:26.07,0:01:30.57,Default,Toko's Mother,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be over on Saturday?\NIt's your grandmother's birthday.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:30.57,0:01:32.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Can't, I have work.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.32,0:01:35.62,Default,Toko's Mother,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have to. We already ordered catering.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.62,0:01:38.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're about to go live. I'm hanging up.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.37,0:01:42.46,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.00,0:01:44.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Same as always.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.54,0:01:47.55,Default,AD,0,0,0,,Please get on standby!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.55,0:01:49.01,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.51,0:01:50.42,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.42,0:01:51.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.88,0:01:53.01,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.06,0:01:58.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's go make our mark!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.77,0:02:00.27,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.78,0:03:42.54,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,What waits beyond the vast seas ahead?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.54,0:03:46.04,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,This week, we'll set off\Non yet another epic journey.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.46,0:03:51.88,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,The quiz show {\i1}Treasure on the Waves{\i0}\Nis brought to you live.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.88,0:03:54.67,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,We're your hosts, Bernard Kento...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.67,0:03:58.51,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,And Wataya Rin. We hope you enjoy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.09,0:04:02.14,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Let's meet our contestants!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.47,0:04:08.81,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,These four guests all come from\Nthe idol agency Production Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.73,0:04:13.27,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm Toko, the reliable big sis of Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.03,0:04:16.40,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm Sena. I handle our looks.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.45,0:04:20.11,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,W-With the singing voice of an angel...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.11,0:04:22.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lu-lu-lu-lu-lu...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.33,0:04:25.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm Lulu, and I love to sing!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.20,0:04:30.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm the youngest member of the agency,\Nthe always energetic Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.21,0:04:33.75,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you for having us!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.09,0:04:40.18,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,These new idols have been making a big splash!\NHow will they do on our show?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.18,0:04:41.76,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,I can't wait to find out!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.05,0:04:44.51,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Now, allow me to explain the rules!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.27,0:04:50.65,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Every time you get a question right,\Nyou progress 1 mile.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.65,0:04:54.07,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,The first person to reach\Nthe treasure island wins.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.07,0:04:57.78,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,All of you are competing\Nto get the treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.90,0:05:03.03,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,The victor will get this treasure chest trophy.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.45,0:05:06.20,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Now the quiz will begin!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.54,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Let's see our first question.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.37,0:05:11.29,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.62,0:05:14.71,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,In a survey conducted this year\Nat elementary schools nationwide,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.71,0:05:19.17,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,what job ranked #1 in careers\Nchildren want to pursue in their future?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.55,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,{\an8}How does this work?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.55,0:05:24.26,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\an8}You write the answer here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.26,0:05:25.85,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8}Elementary school...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.93,0:05:29.52,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's just how it looks on TV!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.31,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now, present your answers one at a time!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.31,0:05:35.52,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Obviously, it's an idol!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.90,0:05:36.94,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,A patissier?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.07,0:05:39.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's a manga artist!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.36,0:05:41.40,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A civil servant, maybe?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.40,0:05:43.36,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,And the answer is...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.70,0:05:44.91,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Manga artist!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.37,0:05:48.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.71,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You sure know a lot\Nabout elementary schoolers.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.71,0:05:51.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.84,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Well done, Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.84,0:05:57.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thanks! I've got this!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.50,0:06:00.97,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The battle's only just begun.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.76,0:06:05.47,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Lilly-san advances 1 mile!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.85,0:06:10.47,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Next is a Close-Up Quiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.69,0:06:15.86,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,What is shown in this footage?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.90,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Contestants, present your answers!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.95,0:06:24.91,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Outer space!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.78,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,A fancy squid.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.12,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,A mizu manju!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.62,0:06:36.25,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, Lulu-san, that's correct!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wow, we got it at the same time!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.59,0:06:39.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.88,0:06:41.76,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Mizu manju...?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.76,0:06:42.97,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.97,0:06:44.80,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Let's look at the footage.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.55,0:06:48.47,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}As you can see, the correct answer is...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.47,0:06:52.64,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}mizu manju, a confection\Nknown for its delicious jiggly texture!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.64,0:06:54.48,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,That's too hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.48,0:06:57.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Where the heck did "fancy squid" come from?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.23,0:06:59.11,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Well, look at it. It's see-through.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.48,0:07:01.86,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Well done, both of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.28,0:07:04.74,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Both of you progress 1 mile!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.49,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Now for a team battle!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.03,0:07:12.37,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Drawing Telephone Quiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.25,0:07:15.62,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,The rules are simple.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.62,0:07:18.50,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,You must draw a prompt\Nto get it across to the next person.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.50,0:07:23.13,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,If the last person can guess the prompt correctly,\Nall players progress 1 mile.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.67,0:07:26.47,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Will the prompt make it to the end?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.51,0:07:26.47,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's hippo. Hippo.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.47,0:07:27.22,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.15,0:07:39.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Here it is, Sena-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.69,0:07:40.82,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.15,0:07:46.99,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.99,0:07:47.78,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.41,0:07:52.58,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What on earth...?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.33,0:07:55.96,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Now, present the answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.41,0:07:58.83,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Let's see Toko's drawing!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.59,0:08:03.84,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,What in the world is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.59,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,S...Seaweed-Man?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.88,0:08:12.14,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Like some sort of superhero\Nfrom Seaweed Planet?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.14,0:08:13.39,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Never heard of it, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.39,0:08:16.64,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that is incorrect.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.64,0:08:19.65,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,The correct answer is "hippo"!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.65,0:08:21.06,Default,All,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's a hippo!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.28,0:08:32.62,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a hippo.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.74,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That can't be a hippo!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.74,0:08:39.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You must've made a mistake\Nand drawn some sort of new monster, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.25,0:08:43.50,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Lulu-san, your art is certainly unique!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.71,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Things are starting to heat up!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.01,0:08:51.51,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Lilly got a head start on\N{\i1}Treasure on the Waves{\i0}...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.51,0:08:53.26,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Lilly-san gets it right!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.35,0:08:58.93,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Just behind her in second place is Lulu-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.14,0:08:58.27,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,{\an8}They're doing good.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.27,0:09:00.10,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wonder who will win!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.10,0:09:01.69,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Sena-san is correct!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.65,0:09:04.82,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Lulu-san and Lilly-san are correct!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.82,0:09:05.86,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.86,0:09:09.49,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Let's review the rankings so far!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.49,0:09:11.86,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Currently in first place is Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.86,0:09:13.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.03,0:09:15.33,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,And in last place is Toko-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.79,0:09:19.91,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Give me the bonus quiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.91,0:09:22.08,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Afraid we can't do that.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.37,0:09:24.84,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Aw, man...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.34,0:09:28.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's no fun if it ends this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.05,0:09:34.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.01,0:09:37.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,make things even more exciting!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.57,0:09:53.20,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.40,0:10:26.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What the? What the?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.61,0:10:32.74,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.74,0:10:35.20,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hell's Quiz{\i0} to begin!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.61,0:10:38.33,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Get the question wrong,\Nand you'll fall into the sea of lava,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.33,0:10:41.20,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,where you'll set sail for hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.70,0:10:42.83,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Hell?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.83,0:10:43.75,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.75,0:10:45.71,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,They didn't mention this at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.59,0:10:51.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh no, my magic's out of control again!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.71,0:10:54.51,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Oh dear, Lilly misfired again!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.51,0:10:55.47,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,That looks bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.47,0:10:58.60,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,What's going on? None of this is in the script!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.60,0:10:59.47,Default,AD,0,0,0,,I'll go check.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.47,0:11:02.22,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,For now, guide them using cue cards.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.22,0:11:03.02,Default,AD,0,0,0,,Will do!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.02,0:11:05.19,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of all this?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.19,0:11:06.10,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.60,0:11:09.11,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,What on earth is he up to?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.57,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Dude, what's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.57,0:11:12.99,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Some new segment?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.11,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,H-Hello, viewers!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.62,0:11:22.12,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Our program is produced with utmost safety in mind,\Nso please do not be concer—
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.87,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Time to break open the gates of hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.87,0:11:26.62,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.13,0:11:30.63,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Four glass floors remain.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.63,0:11:31.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So hot!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.92,0:11:32.88,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.88,0:11:35.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We'll be okay... right?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.38,0:11:37.09,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko, what do we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.09,0:11:39.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm sure this is just staged.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But it'll be pretty bad if we fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.10,0:11:44.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's, err, gotten pretty fun, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.56,0:11:47.06,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Now, the Hell's Quiz.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.77,0:11:49.56,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Here's the question.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.44,0:11:54.49,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Nebuchadnezzar II, the son of Nabopolassar,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.49,0:11:57.53,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,rebuilt Babylon in the 6th century BC.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.53,0:12:01.45,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,What is the name of the structure\Nsaid to be built by him for the queen?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.24,0:12:03.83,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.83,0:12:06.41,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Th-That's a pretty tough question...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.08,0:12:11.42,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,State your answer.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The Hanging Gardens.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.05,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Oh. That's correct.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.05,0:12:21.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Wow! How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.76,0:12:24.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It was in the trivia book\NI was reading backstage.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.60,0:12:26.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.39,0:12:27.89,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,You got it right...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.89,0:12:31.36,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,but since everyone else got it wrong...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.36,0:12:34.02,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,you'll all fall down one floor!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.24,0:12:39.53,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.53,0:12:40.49,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You're going too far!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.49,0:12:42.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This isn't what I had in mind!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.95,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Lulu-san, well done getting the answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.87,0:12:50.67,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,I guess I made the question too easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.67,0:12:53.92,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,I'll try to make the next quiz even harder to answer.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.92,0:12:55.13,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.13,0:12:58.76,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,The "What Are Idols Into?" Quiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.18,0:13:03.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh? That's my phone!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.30,0:13:04.51,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Here's the question!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.51,0:13:09.52,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,What has Toko-san gotten into searching lately?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.77,0:13:11.48,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.81,0:13:12.86,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,It wasn't me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.86,0:13:15.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,He wasn't kidding. This {\i1}is{\i0} hard to answer.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Toko-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.32,0:13:19.82,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.36,0:13:23.66,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,If you don't answer,\Nyou will fall another floor!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.66,0:13:26.54,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Here's a hint: it's something\Nshe's struggling with!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.58,0:13:29.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.12,0:13:31.92,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Is it what I think it is?\NOr wait... not that!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.92,0:13:33.92,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I don't remember, but it can't be good!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.30,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,State your answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.30,0:13:39.72,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,"Tricks to getting smarter".
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.76,0:13:42.97,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's wrong!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.97,0:13:45.01,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm not dumb!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.51,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,That's something you struggle with, no?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.06,0:13:51.56,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,State your answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.56,0:13:54.02,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,"How to be less shy around your juniors"!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.23,0:13:56.90,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to be about me?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.11,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Sorry, that's wrong!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.11,0:14:01.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You were struggling with that,\Nso I looked it up for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.57,0:14:03.70,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Well, cut it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.70,0:14:06.53,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Why? You opened up to me about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.53,0:14:07.45,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.45,0:14:08.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.29,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I really didn't!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.99,0:14:08.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Um, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're live!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.58,0:14:13.62,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,All of this is reaching the airwaves!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.75,0:14:19.17,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Time's up! The answer is...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.67,0:14:20.67,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,this!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.13,0:14:25.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"Top ways to get slim easily"...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.93,0:14:28.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.18,0:14:30.02,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So you're on a diet?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.02,0:14:31.31,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.31,0:14:33.69,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Dear, everyone got it wrong! Which means...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.69,0:14:35.69,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Hell Power...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.69,0:14:38.32,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Up!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.78,0:14:44.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for it to go this far!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.16,0:14:49.28,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,They're getting closer and closer\Nto the lava, and that's real trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.75,0:14:56.50,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Next will be a Hell VCR Quiz.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.50,0:15:00.50,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Guess who is responsible\Nfor sneakily eating everyone's cakes.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, I bought those!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.76,0:15:08.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You bought cakes?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.18,0:15:10.39,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah, for all of us to eat together.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.68,0:15:13.27,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,And someone ate them...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.27,0:15:16.56,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Just who is the one responsible?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.78,0:15:25.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh no, what now?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.40,0:15:27.78,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,They're gonna find out it was me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.78,0:15:33.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula, end the quiz already!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.93,0:15:54.31,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Here comes the dragon!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.93,0:15:56.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.64,0:16:00.81,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It was me! I did it! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.07,0:16:03.32,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,That's correct!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.32,0:16:06.57,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,But as punishment for stealing their food...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.57,0:16:08.20,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,the glass will break.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.70,0:16:18.42,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,This has gotten real bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.42,0:16:21.42,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Now for the final question\Nyou've been waiting for...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.42,0:16:23.71,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,A Comeback Quiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.63,0:16:30.34,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Whoever gets this right\Nwill progress 100 miles at once!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.34,0:16:33.76,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,The roulette will decide\Nwho answers this question!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.10,0:16:38.44,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Toko-san, you're the lucky contestant!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.81,0:16:40.52,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Why do you keep targeting me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.52,0:16:42.27,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Now for the question.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.65,0:16:48.03,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Who was Kandachi Toko's first love?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.28,0:16:51.74,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What kind of question is that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.74,0:16:54.41,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Hurry up and answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.41,0:16:58.58,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.25,0:17:02.17,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,State your answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.96,0:17:06.67,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,M-My pet dog Yasshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.67,0:17:09.93,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that's wrong!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But it {\i1}is{\i0} Yasshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.19,0:17:22.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,There has to be something I can do.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.69,0:17:23.77,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Right, magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.77,0:17:25.90,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,No good! No good!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.77,0:17:25.90,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,{\an8}What now? What now?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.11,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.11,0:17:31.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I left my wand behind...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.82,0:17:37.16,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Try again, state your answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.71,0:17:44.33,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,This is your last chance! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.59,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Knock it off already!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.01,0:17:51.05,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,She already told you it was Yasshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.47,0:17:56.43,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.93,0:17:58.77,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,There I go.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.77,0:18:00.39,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.86,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,W-We apologize for the indecent display.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.86,0:18:14.99,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,There was a mistake with our previous question.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.45,0:18:20.00,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Let's try again: this is the final question,\Nand your chance to make a big comeback!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.46,0:18:27.59,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,The name of your agency is Production... what?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.88,0:18:32.13,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Go on! Answer, answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.47,0:18:39.35,Default,All,0,0,0,,Me! Me! I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.10,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Contestants, state your answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.77,0:18:47.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Ready, and...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.32,Default,All,0,0,0,,Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.32,0:18:52.57,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Bingo! That's correct!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.96,0:19:10.42,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Everyone wins! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.76,0:19:22.22,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Your long journey now reaches its end.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.77,0:19:27.73,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,The quiz show {\i1}Treasure on the Waves{\i0}\Nhopes to have you again for another adventure!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.73,0:19:29.61,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.57,Default,Multiple,0,0,0,,{\an8}Farewell...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.61,0:19:31.19,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.28,0:19:33.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.08,0:19:42.74,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,That Hell's Quiz sure was crazy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.33,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,They can really do anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.50,0:19:54.59,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,What made you think any of that was okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.09,0:19:58.09,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,What if something had happened\Nto those girls?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.09,0:20:00.60,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Seriously, don't do that.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.60,0:20:03.06,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.06,0:20:06.06,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,It really felt like I was possessed by something.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.06,0:20:07.60,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.06,0:20:07.60,Default,AD,0,0,0,,{\an8}Miss Producer.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.31,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.31,0:20:12.98,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,Those were the highest ratings we've ever gotten?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.44,0:20:15.69,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,We'll let you off this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.69,0:20:17.32,Default,Producer,0,0,0,,But watch yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.45,0:20:26.29,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Really, what was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.59,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.38,0:20:38.72,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Today was tough, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.09,0:20:40.97,Default,All,0,0,0,,Good work to you too.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.09,0:20:40.97,Alt,All,0,0,0,,Good work to you too.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.97,0:20:42.72,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,Get some good rest, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.72,0:20:43.60,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We will.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.15,0:20:53.52,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,I need a massage before I go home...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.07,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,That was freaky.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.07,0:20:58.07,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I was so nervous!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.45,0:21:00.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm so sweaty...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.36,0:21:01.70,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,They're back!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.66,0:21:06.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.29,0:21:10.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Th-That was something...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.25,0:21:13.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Quiz shows are more than meets the eye.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.59,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Are quiz shows normally like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.59,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I feel like I pushed myself hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.30,0:21:21.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But it was very fun... I think?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.39,0:21:28.35,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I thought we were gonna die.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.35,0:21:32.90,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko, you almost broke down in tears.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.90,0:21:35.48,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You were making a funny face too, Sena!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.48,0:21:37.15,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Was I really?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.61,0:21:39.53,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Well, we were all terrified.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.70,0:21:43.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.92,0:21:56.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, who was your first love anyways, Toko-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.46,0:21:58.38,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You wanna know?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.71,0:22:00.55,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It was...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.55,0:22:03.22,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,There was no such thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.22,0:22:06.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,More importantly,\Nabout those cakes I put in the fridge...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.64,0:22:07.93,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You glutton.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.31,0:22:10.43,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Our cakes...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.14,0:22:14.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.48,0:22:16.86,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! They just looked so good!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.65,0:22:21.15,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,We'll go buy more!
Comment: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:38.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,Fun in Just a Minute! Ultimate Trivia
