Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.75,0:22:34.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(My dream!){「my dream！」}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.63,0:22:37.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I just wanna know what the future holds{「明日の扉の向こう期待しちゃう」}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:37.55,0:22:38.17,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(Alone!){「alone！」}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:38.17,0:22:42.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Even if the stars in a moonless sky{もしも月のない 空に星が}
